{"v":1,"book":"gita","n":16,"title":"Divine and the demonic qualities","narrator":{"name":"Sonia","voice":"en-GB-SoniaNeural"},"duration":239.424,"scenes":[{"layout":"title","headline":"Divine and Demonic Qualities","visual":["Two ways to live"],"L":[],"say":"Chapter Sixteen. The Divine and the Demonic Qualities. A plain-spoken chapter about the two directions a human life can take.","start":0.0,"at":0.576,"end":10.464,"words":[[0.113,0.45,"Chapter"],[0.575,0.75,"Sixteen"],[1.725,0.113,"The"],[1.85,0.588,"Divine"],[2.45,0.163,"and"],[2.625,0.113,"the"],[2.75,0.537,"Demonic"],[3.3,0.787,"Qualities"],[4.463,0.113,"A"],[4.588,0.75,"plain-spoken"],[5.35,0.537,"chapter"],[5.9,0.338,"about"],[6.25,0.1,"the"],[6.362,0.225,"two"],[6.6,0.6,"directions"],[7.213,0.037,"a"],[7.263,0.362,"human"],[7.638,0.325,"life"],[7.975,0.175,"can"],[8.162,0.487,"take"]]},{"layout":"story","headline":"The divine qualities","visual":["Fearlessness, purity, charity, self-control","Truthfulness, nonviolence, compassion","Forgiveness, modesty, absence of malice"],"L":["L1"],"say":"Krishna begins with a list of qualities to grow toward: fearlessness, purity of heart, steadiness in knowledge, charity, self-control, study, honesty, nonviolence, truthfulness, freedom from anger, renunciation, peace, compassion, gentleness, modesty, forgiveness, and freedom from malice and pride. These, he says, are the marks of the divine.","start":10.464,"at":11.04,"end":36.792,"words":[[0.1,0.438,"Krishna"],[0.55,0.388,"begins"],[0.95,0.125,"with"],[1.087,0.037,"a"],[1.137,0.287,"list"],[1.438,0.1,"of"],[1.55,0.512,"qualities"],[2.075,0.087,"to"],[2.175,0.225,"grow"],[2.413,0.487,"toward"],[3.25,0.762,"fearlessness"],[4.237,0.412,"purity"],[4.662,0.087,"of"],[4.763,0.412,"heart"],[5.438,0.55,"steadiness"],[6.0,0.125,"in"],[6.138,0.475,"knowledge"],[6.85,0.562,"charity"],[7.7,0.8,"self-control"],[8.75,0.463,"study"],[9.5,0.512,"honesty"],[10.287,0.812,"nonviolence"],[11.35,0.738,"truthfulness"],[12.363,0.362,"freed